===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|bizan|bīzan|lang=goh}}, from {{proto|gem-pro|bītanan|lang=de}}. Cognate with Dutch {{term|bijten|lang=nl}} and English {{term|bite|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈbaɪ̯sn̩/|/ˈbaɪ̯sən/|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-strong|class=1|beißt|biss|gebissen}}

# {{transitive|or|intransitive}} to [[bite]]
# {{transitive|or|intransitive}} to [[sting]]; to [[burn]]; to be [[sharp]]; to be [[spicy]]
# {{reflexive|colloquial|of colors|lang=de}} to [[clash]]

